        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Tom Jankiewicz, Minnie Driver, John Cusack, Alan Arkin, Dan Aykroyd\n- Works: Grosse Pointe Blank, About a Boy, Speechless\n- Organizations: NBC, ABC\n- Roles: screenwriter, actress, singer-songwriter\n\nFacts:\n- Tom Jankiewicz was born on September 8, 1963, and died on January 23, 2013.\n- Tom Jankiewicz was an American screenwriter.\n- Minnie Driver was born on January 31, 1970.\n- Minnie Driver is an English actress and singer-songwriter.\n- Tom Jankiewicz was best known for writing the 1997 film \"Grosse Pointe Blank.\"\n- \"Grosse Pointe Blank\" starred John Cusack, Minnie Driver, Alan Arkin, and Dan Aykroyd.\n- Minnie Driver starred as Fiona Bowa on the NBC sitcom \"About a Boy.\"\n- Minnie Driver currently stars as Maya DiMeo on the ABC sitcom \"Speechless.\"",
